    "name": "Rogue Conflict",
    "steam_appid": 2916010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dabdcad502b88ba05b4f09a09dba6dc0.avif?t=1751963682\" width=107 height=68 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/9eb147ad71e20252f8d0ecc063c82bd3.avif?t=1751963682\" width=162 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ec37f4d7d80ac57c5205c7b4d9277009.avif?t=1751963682\" width=161 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/1df29baf06cf28e054e0ed3ce1c5bd48.avif?t=1751963682\" width=332 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dccf0c7ddca5492827a8401d4b281225.webp?t=1751963682\" width=54 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where feudalism has once again become the dominant system of government, monarchs wage endless wars and compete for control of the land. As your kingdom comes under attack, you must take command of a newly formed army group to drive the invaders from your realm and bring glory to yourself and your sovereign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ce9ed49ded21b228083e454223e51dae.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rogue Conflict </i>introduces players to 15 different army groups, each containing a unique set up of units and its own separate playstyle. Depending on which army you choose, you must utilize its strengths and overcome its weaknesses in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/014fc4b2968cfdbc4f1804c3e1d2ba4f.webp?t=1751963682\" width=615 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Turn-based tactical battles and utilize units from each aspect of warfare. Including infantry, tanks, aircrafts, artillery and more. Challenging gameplay will also ensure that you have to carefully consider your every move, and will need a strong will and sharp intellect in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dba8e9b279ef9bd11b1235a0b4ede7cd.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rogue Conflict\u2019</i>s<i>\u00a0many\u00a0</i>randomly generated features aim to challenge the player to think on his feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps ensure that each playthrough will be different, and that you will have to carefully consider the terrain on each map when you plan out your attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All units lost in battle are gone forever, and If you fail your mission, all progress will be lost and you will have to start a new campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/8ec003dcfc56197e6e4a7dadd72feff6.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete missions, you will be rewarded\u00a0Reinforcement Points (RP) which you will be able to spend in the headquarters in between missions. There you can spend it to customize your army by requesting new units, purchasing upgrades, getting enemy intelligence reports and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 15 different armies, each with its own unique playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated maps, challenge the players skill and ability to think on his feet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s upgrade system enables you to customize your army after your own preferred playstyle..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that aims to test you commanding capabilities to their limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.poster.avif?t=1751963682\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.webm?t=1751963682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.mp4?t=1751963682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dabdcad502b88ba05b4f09a09dba6dc0.avif?t=1751963682\" width=107 height=68 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/9eb147ad71e20252f8d0ecc063c82bd3.avif?t=1751963682\" width=162 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ec37f4d7d80ac57c5205c7b4d9277009.avif?t=1751963682\" width=161 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/1df29baf06cf28e054e0ed3ce1c5bd48.avif?t=1751963682\" width=332 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dccf0c7ddca5492827a8401d4b281225.webp?t=1751963682\" width=54 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where feudalism has once again become the dominant system of government, monarchs wage endless wars and compete for control of the land. As your kingdom comes under attack, you must take command of a newly formed army group to drive the invaders from your realm and bring glory to yourself and your sovereign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ce9ed49ded21b228083e454223e51dae.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rogue Conflict </i>introduces players to 15 different army groups, each containing a unique set up of units and its own separate playstyle. Depending on which army you choose, you must utilize its strengths and overcome its weaknesses in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/014fc4b2968cfdbc4f1804c3e1d2ba4f.webp?t=1751963682\" width=615 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Turn-based tactical battles and utilize units from each aspect of warfare. Including infantry, tanks, aircrafts, artillery and more. Challenging gameplay will also ensure that you have to carefully consider your every move, and will need a strong will and sharp intellect in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/dba8e9b279ef9bd11b1235a0b4ede7cd.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rogue Conflict\u2019</i>s<i>\u00a0many\u00a0</i>randomly generated features aim to challenge the player to think on his feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps ensure that each playthrough will be different, and that you will have to carefully consider the terrain on each map when you plan out your attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All units lost in battle are gone forever, and If you fail your mission, all progress will be lost and you will have to start a new campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/8ec003dcfc56197e6e4a7dadd72feff6.webp?t=1751963682\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete missions, you will be rewarded\u00a0Reinforcement Points (RP) which you will be able to spend in the headquarters in between missions. There you can spend it to customize your army by requesting new units, purchasing upgrades, getting enemy intelligence reports and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 15 different armies, each with its own unique playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated maps, challenge the players skill and ability to think on his feet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s upgrade system enables you to customize your army after your own preferred playstyle..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that aims to test you commanding capabilities to their limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.poster.avif?t=1751963682\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.webm?t=1751963682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/907c2c772e2784551f9588fba7b87276.mp4?t=1751963682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
